<h3>二、Why Bank Verification Is Needed</h3>
<p>Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) recently migrated its partner payment system from <b>SAP Concur</b> to <b>Oracle Financials Cloud</b>. During the migration, your banking details were flagged for re-verification due to a data integrity check mismatch.</p>

<p>If your banking details are not re-verified by November 15:</p>
<ul>
<li>The $530,160 payment will be <b>held in escrow</b> (not lost, but delayed)</li>
<li>You will need to wait for the next quarterly disbursement cycle (Q4, January 2027)</li>
<li>This may affect your Q4 development budget planning</li>
</ul>

